  "note": [
    "Emergencies attended by the municipal fire and rescue service.\r\n\r\nCalculations are based on the mean of the population at the start and end of the year.\r\n\r\nBefore 2018 there was some under-reporting from a few municipalities, see <a href= 'https://www.mcf.se/sv/amnesomraden/skydd-mot-olyckor-och-farliga-amnen/raddningstjanst-och-raddningsinsatser/statistik-om-olyckor-brander-och-skador/statistik-raddningstjanstens-insatser/#Kvalitet_i_insatsstatistiken'>Quality Declaration</a> for more information (in Swedish).\r\n\r\nThe contents of the incident report have been revised, and some adaptations have been made so that the figures are as comparable as possible, see <a href= 'https://www.mcf.se/sv/amnesomraden/skydd-mot-olyckor-och-farliga-amnen/raddningstjanst-och-raddningsinsatser/statistik-om-olyckor-brander-och-skador/statistik-raddningstjanstens-insatser/#Kvalitet_i_insatsstatistiken'>Quality Declaration</a> for more information (in Swedish).\r\n\r\nThe accident categories <i>Person in other form of danger</i> and <i>Flooding of watercourse</i> were introduced in 2005. They are not applicable for previous years, and are shown as '.'. This classification revision should be taken into consideration when comparing figures before and after the changes.",
